them in with food and the promise of dank and fetid places to sleep. Keep them in line with the back of your hand and the threat of dire consequences. Pit their scaly hides against the best that the Forces of Good can muster, and they’ll die for you as they rip steaming entrails out of the hapless heroes.\n\nIt’s a degenerate and nasty job…and you love it. Yes, home is where your heart is. In a box. Packed in salt. That's right — Dungeon Keeper, Bullfrog's classic dungeon management strategy, gives you no extra credit for having any morals. After all, the underworld isn't black and white!\n\nKey features:\n\n• Revolutionary game packed with tons of dark humor, an impressive variety of hellish creatures, and highly addictive gameplay\n\n• Build your dungeon & protect it with a labyrinth of dark corridors, a web of deadly traps, an arsenal of powerful spells, and an army of bloodthirsty demons\n\n• A refreshing title for someone tired of rescuing princesses, saving worlds, and all that love, happiness, and political correctness junk. Just this once, be the bad guy!","aboutGame":null},"vi":{"status":"pending_translation","provider":null,"shortDescription":null,"detailedDescription":null,"aboutGame":null}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996630/header.jpg?t=1777495003"},{"role":"capsule","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996630/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1777495003"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996630/ss_b43fdd32797a907a32b40db508aceb931236fa82.600x338.jpg?t=1777495003","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996630/ss_b43fdd32797a907a32b40db508aceb931236fa82.1920x1080.jpg?t=1777495003"},{"id":1,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996630/ss_b3dfde07de061dd7aac9cf2916aeb695aa3ee191.600x338.jpg?t=177